msgstr "受入オペレーション"

#. module: stock_acceptance_label
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_acceptance_label.field_stock_move_line__acceptance_number
msgid ""
"Acceptance number of this detailed operation. It is the number printed on "
"the label, and the one kept on the lot it is received in."
msgstr ""
"この詳細オペレーションの受入番号。ラベルに印字される番号であり、入荷先のロッ"
"トにも保持されます。"

#. module: stock_acceptance_label
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_acceptance_label.field_stock_lot__acceptance_number
msgid ""
"Acceptance numbers the lot was received under. A lot received several times "
"carries them all, separated by commas."
msgstr ""
"このロットが入荷した際の受入番号。複数回入荷したロットはそのすべてをカンマ区"
"切りで保持します。"

#. module: stock_acceptance_label
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:stock_acceptance_label.acceptance_label
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:stock_acceptance_label.res_config_settings_view_form
