msgstr "コンフィグ設定"

#. module: stock_acceptance_label
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_acceptance_label.field_stock_lot__acceptance_move_line_ids
msgid ""
"Detailed operations the lot appears in, which the acceptance numbers of the "
"lot are read from."
msgstr ""
"このロットが含まれる詳細オペレーション。ロットの受入番号はここから取得されま"
"す。"

#. module: stock_acceptance_label
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:stock_acceptance_label.acceptance_label
msgid "Expiration Date"
msgstr "使用期限"

#. module: stock_acceptance_label
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:stock_acceptance_label.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Field printed as the arrival date on the acceptance label"
msgstr "受入ラベルに入荷日として印字するフィールド"

#. module: stock_acceptance_label
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_acceptance_label.field_res_company__acceptance_label_arrival_date_field_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_acceptance_label.field_res_config_settings__acceptance_label_arrival_date_field_id
msgid ""
"Field printed as the arrival date on the acceptance label. Date fields of "
"the transfer and of its lines can be selected, and datetime fields are "
"converted to the user time zone. The effective date of the transfer is used "
"when this is left empty."
msgstr ""
"受入ラベルに入荷日として印字するフィールド。転送およびその明細の日付・日時フィールドを選択でき、日時フィールドはユーザのタイムゾーンに変換されます。空欄の場合は転送の実施日が使用されます。"

#. module: stock_acceptance_label
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:stock_acceptance_label.acceptance_label
msgid "Lot No."
msgstr "ロットNo."

#. module: stock_acceptance_label
