msgstr "プロダクトの移動(在庫移動ライン)"

#. module: stock_acceptance_label
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:stock_acceptance_label.acceptance_label
msgid "Product Name"
msgstr "製品の名前"

#. module: stock_acceptance_label
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:stock_acceptance_label.acceptance_label
msgid "Status"
msgstr "ステータス"

#. module: stock_acceptance_label
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:stock_acceptance_label.field_res_company__acceptance_label_status_html
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:stock_acceptance_label.field_res_config_settings__acceptance_label_status_html
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:stock_acceptance_label.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Status Area"
msgstr "ステータス欄"

#. module: stock_acceptance_label
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:stock_acceptance_label.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Status area printed on the acceptance label, to be filled in by hand"
msgstr "受入ラベルに印字する、手書きで記入するためのステータス欄"

#. module: stock_acceptance_label
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_acceptance_label.field_res_company__acceptance_label_status_html
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_acceptance_label.field_res_config_settings__acceptance_label_status_html
msgid ""
"Status area printed on the acceptance label. It is meant to be filled in by "
"hand, and can be edited freely as long as it stays within a few lines: the "
"label has a fixed height, and anything that does not fit is cut off. Empty "
"it to restore the built-in status area."
msgstr ""
"受入ラベルに印字するステータス欄。手書きで記入するための欄で、数行に収まる範囲であれば自由に編集できます。ラベルの高さは固定されているため、収まらない部分は切り捨てられます。空欄にすると既定のステータス欄に戻ります。"

#. module: stock_acceptance_label
#: model:ir.model,name:stock_acceptance_label.model_stock_move
msgid "Stock Move"
msgstr "在庫移動"

#. module: stock_acceptance_label
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_acceptance_label.field_stock_move__acceptance_number
msgid ""
"Summary of the acceptance numbers of the detailed operations of the line. A "
"line of a product without tracking can be numbered here directly; a tracked "
"one is numbered per lot in its detailed operations."
msgstr ""
"この明細の詳細オペレーションの受入番号のまとめ。追跡のないプロダクトの明細は"
"ここで直接入力でき、追跡のあるプロダクトは詳細オペレーションでロットごとに入"
"力します。"

#. module: stock_acceptance_label
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_acceptance_label.field_stock_picking__acceptance_number
msgid "Summary of the acceptance numbers of the lines of the transfer."
msgstr "転送の明細の受入番号のまとめ。"

#. module: stock_acceptance_label
#: model:ir.model,name:stock_acceptance_label.model_stock_picking
msgid "Transfer"
msgstr "転送"

#. module: stock_acceptance_label
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:stock_acceptance_label.acceptance_label_status
